                "senderName": "NWS Fairbanks AK",
                "headline": "Winter Weather Advisory issued November 12 at 3:25AM AKST until November 12 at 4:00PM AKST by NWS Fairbanks AK",
                "description": "* WHAT...Snow and blowing snow. Additional snow accumulations up to 2\ninches. Winds gusting as high as 45 mph.\n\n* WHERE...Northern and Western Arctic Coast.\n\n* WHEN...Until 4 PM AKST this afternoon.\n\n* IMPACTS...Travel could be difficult. Snow and blowing snow could\nreduce visibility below one half mile at times. Periods of blizzard\nconditions will be intermittently possible.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...Areas of blowing snow will persist through the\nend of the week as gusty winds and snow showers continue.",
